# Private/source visual references are research inputs only. Generated masters
# live under scripts/anime-art/raw; downloaded official references never ship.
scripts/anime-art/refs/
# Hidden Leaf follows the newest (Azur Lane) precedent: ship only the BUILT
# webp faces under public/. The multi-MB illustration masters, per-card review
# renders and the commander source PNG are regenerable build inputs — keep them
# out of git (they bloat clones and the Vercel function trace).
scripts/anime-art/raw/hidden-leaf/
scripts/anime-art/previews/hidden-leaf/
scripts/commander-art/might_guy.png
# Offline Heavenly Demon compositor deployment scratch; public/ holds the
# promoted WebPs and scripts/anime-art/raw/heavenly-demon holds source masters.
scripts/anime-art/raw/heavenly-demon/_staged/

# Machine-local Claude Code session files. The repo intentionally TRACKS
# .claude/commands/ — ignore only these per-machine session artifacts.
.claude/launch.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Binary game media lives on the Cloudflare R2 CDN, not in git (docs/media-manifest.md):
# media-manifest.json is the source of truth for which files exist, `npm run media:publish`
# uploads new/changed files, `npm run media:pull` restores them locally. Ignored PER
# EXTENSION so the tracked code/doc files inside these trees (public/sounds/manifest.json,
# durations.json, READMEs) stay in git. Keep in lockstep with MEDIA_EXTENSIONS in
# scripts/lib/media-manifest.mjs.
public/assets/**/*.webp
public/assets/**/*.png
public/assets/**/*.jpg
public/assets/**/*.jpeg
public/assets/**/*.gif
public/assets/**/*.svg
public/assets/**/*.avif
public/assets/**/*.mp4
public/assets/**/*.webm
public/assets/**/*.mp3
public/assets/**/*.ogg
public/assets/**/*.wav
public/sounds/**/*.webp
public/sounds/**/*.png
public/sounds/**/*.jpg
public/sounds/**/*.jpeg
public/sounds/**/*.gif
public/sounds/**/*.svg
public/sounds/**/*.avif
public/sounds/**/*.mp4
public/sounds/**/*.webm
public/sounds/**/*.mp3
public/sounds/**/*.ogg
public/sounds/**/*.wav
public/**/*.part
